                    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
                        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-slate-800">At Gauteng Property Finance, the focus is simple — helping you secure the right home financing solution for your situation.</p>
                    
                        <div class="prose prose-lg">
                            <p>This isn't a traditional bank environment. Instead, you're dealing with specialists who focus on property finance every single day. The goal is to make the process simpler, more flexible, and far easier to understand.</p>
                            <p>You get a more personal experience, real guidance, and solutions designed around your needs rather than a one-size-fits-all approach. By connecting directly to competitive lending sources, the aim is always to secure the most suitable home loan structure while keeping costs as competitive as possible.</p>
                            <p>Property finance is not just another service — it's the core focus. From first-time buyers to experienced property investors, the priority is helping you navigate the home loan process with confidence and clarity.</p>
                            <p>Transparency also matters. You should always know exactly what you're signing up for. That means clear communication, straightforward advice, and no hidden surprises along the way.</p>
                        </div>
                    
