        <!-- FIRST-TIME BUYERS -->
        <section id="firsttime" class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
                <div class="text-center mb-16">
                    <span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">FOR FIRST-TIME BUYERS</span>
                    <h2 class="text-5xl font-bold mt-3">Home Loan for First-Time Buyers</h2>
                </div>
            
                <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-600">
                    <p class="text-2xl leading-tight">Buying your first home is an exciting step, and for most people it's one of the biggest financial decisions you'll ever make. That's where Gauteng Property Finance comes in. You don't have to figure it all out on your own. With the right guidance and the right finance structure, you can move forward with confidence.</p>
                
                    <div class="my-12 bg-white rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-sm">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 flex items-center gap-x-3">
                            <span class="text-emerald-500">1.</span> Are you ready to buy?
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-lg">Before you start looking at homes, it's important to ask yourself one simple question: Are you financially ready for a long-term commitment like a home loan?</p>
                        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-6">
                            <li class="flex gap-x-4">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <span>Earn a stable monthly income and your job situation is secure? You may qualify.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex gap-x-4">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <span>Self-employed? We specialise in helping you too.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex gap-x-4">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i>
                                <span>Monthly bond repayment + rates + insurance should ideally stay within 25%-30% of gross income.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-8">Important things to consider</h3>
                    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl">
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-4">Type of home</h4>
                            <p>Your first home doesn't have to be your dream mansion. A small apartment may be the perfect starting point.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl">
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-4">Location matters</h4>
                            <p>Close to work, schools, shops, medical facilities. Safety and long-term property value are key.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-16 mb-8">Useful tips when house-hunting</h3>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="timeline-step bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100">
                            <div class="text-emerald-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">01</div>
                            <p class="font-medium">Take photos with your phone</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">After seeing several properties in one day, details blur together.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-step bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100">
                            <div class="text-emerald-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">02</div>
                            <p class="font-medium">Make notes about each property</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">Layout, size, condition, unique features.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-step bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100">
                            <div class="text-emerald-500 text-4xl font-bold mb-4">03</div>
                            <p class="font-medium">Visit shortlisted homes again</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">A second viewing reveals what you missed first time.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
